na.\",\"url\":\"https://mlbbhub.com/heroes/karina#build-jungle-sustain-snowball\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToStep\",\"position\":3,\"name\":\"Buy Concentrated Energy\",\"text\":\"Purchase Concentrated Energy (2,020 gold) as item 3 in the Jungle Sustain Snowball build for Karina.\",\"url\":\"https://mlbbhub.com/heroes/karina#build-jungle-sustain-snowball\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToStep\",\"position\":4,\"name\":\"Buy Holy Crystal\",\"text\":\"Purchase Holy Crystal (3,000 gold) as item 4 in the Jungle Sustain Snowball build for Karina.\",\"url\":\"https://mlbbhub.com/heroes/karina#build-jungle-sustain-snowball\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToStep\",\"position\":5,\"name\":\"Buy Divine Glaive\",\"text\":\"Purchase Divine Glaive (1,970 gold) as item 5 in the Jungle Sustain Snowball build for Karina.\",\"url\":\"https://mlbbhub.com/heroes/karina#build-jungle-sustain-snowball\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToStep\",\"position\":6,\"name\":\"Buy Blood Wings\",\"text\":\"Purchase Blood Wings (2,100 gold) as item 6 in the Jungle Sustain Snowball build for Karina.\",\"url\":\"https://mlbbhub.com/heroes/karina#build-jungle-sustain-snowball\"}],\"mainEntityOfPage\":{\"@type\":\"WebPage\",\"@id\":\"https://mlbbhub.com/heroes/karina\"},\"datePublished\":\"2026-04-18T00:00:00.000Z\",\"dateModified\":\"2026-05-13T00:00:00.000Z\",\"author\":{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"MLBBHub\",\"url\":\"https://mlbbhub.com\"}}5e:[\"$\",\"script\",\"1\",{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"$63\"}}]\n64:T96d,{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"HowTo\",\"name\":\"How to Build Karina in Mobile Legends: Jungle Defensive Tempo\",\"description\":\"Defensive jungle variant for high-collapse drafts, trading some burst ceiling for enough durability to finish the first target and leave.\",\"totalTime\":\"PT15M\",\"supply\":[{\"@type\":\"HowToSupply\",\"name\":\"Tough Boots\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToSupply\",\"name\":\"Starlium Scythe\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToSupply\",\"name\":\"Concentrated Energy\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToSupply\",\"name\":\"Brute Force Breastplate\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToSupply\",\"name\":\"Holy Crystal\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToSupply\",\"name\":\"Winter Crown\"}],\"tool\":[{\"@type\":\"HowToTool\",\"name\":\"Basic Common Emblem\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToTool\",\"name\":\"Retribution Battle Spell\"}],\"step\":[{\"@type\":\"HowToStep\",\"position\":1,\"name\":\"Buy Tough Boots\",\"text\":\"Purchase Tough Boots (700 gold) as item 1 in the Jungle Defensive Tempo build for Karina.\",\"url\":\"https://mlbbhub.com/heroes/karina#build-jungle-defensive-tempo\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToStep\",\"position\":2,\"name\":\"Buy Starlium Scythe\",\"text\":\"Purchase Starlium Scythe (2,220 gold) as item 2 in the Jungle Defensive Tempo build for Karina.\",\"url\":\"https://mlbbhub.com/heroes/karina#build-jungle-defensive-tempo\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToStep\",\"position\":3,\"name\":\"Buy Concentrated Energy\",\"text\":\"Purchase Concentrated Energy (2,020 gold) as item 3 in the Jungle Defensive Tempo build for Karina.\",\"url\":\"https://mlbbhub.com/heroes/karina#build-jungle-defensive-tempo\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToStep\",\"position\":4,\"name\":\"Buy Brute Force Breastplate\",\"text\":\"Purchase Brute Force Breastplate (1,870 gold) as item 4 in the Jungle Defensive Tempo build for Karina.\",\"url\":\"https://mlbbhub.com/heroes/karina#build-jungle-defensive-tempo\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToStep\",\"position\":5,\"name\":\"Buy Holy Crystal\",\"text\":\"Purchase Holy Crystal (3,000 gold) as item 5 in the Jungle Defensive Tempo build for Karina.\",\"url\":\"https://mlbbhub.com/heroes/karina#build-jungle-defensive-tempo\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToStep\",\"position\":6,\"name\":\"Buy Winter Crown\",\"text\":\"Purchase Winter Crown (1,910 gold) as item 6 in the Jungle Defensive Tempo build for Karina.\",\"url\":\"https://mlbbhub.com/heroes/karina#build-jungle-defensive-tempo\"}],\"mainEntityOfPage\":{\"@type\":\"WebPage\",\"@id\":\"https://mlbbhub.com/heroes/karina\"},\"datePublished\":\"2026-04-18T00:00:00.000Z\",\"dateModified\":\"2026-05-13T00:00:00.000Z\",\"author\":{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"MLBBHub\",\"url\":\"https://mlbbhub.com\"}}5f:[\"$\",\"script\",\"2\",{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"$64\"}}]\n60:[\"$\",\"$L65\",null,{\"hero\":{\"id\":8,\"name\":\"Karina\",\"slug\":\"karina\",\"title\":\"Shadow Blade\",\"role\":[\"Assassin\"],\"specialty\":[\"Finisher\",\"Magic Damage\"],\"lane\":[\"Jungle\"],\"tier\":\"C\",\"difficulty\":2,\"releaseYear\":2016,\"stats\":{\"durability\":50,\"offense\":70,\"controlEffect\":10,\"difficulty\":50},\"winRate\":47.8,\"pickRate\":0.83,\"banRate\":3.26,\"counters\":{\"strongAgainst\":[{\"heroSlug\":\"layla\",\"heroName\":\"Layla\",\"advantage\":\"strong\",\"tip\":\"Karina counters Marksmen that lack mobility, such as Layla and Hanabi, since her 1st Skill can neutralize their Basic Attacks and they can't escape her high mobility and burst damage.\"},{\"heroSlug\":\"hanabi\",\"heroName\":\"Hanabi\",\"advantage\":\"strong\",\"tip\":\"Karina counters Marksmen that lack mobility, such as Layla and Hanabi, since her 1st Skill can neutralize their Basic Attacks and they can't escape her high mobility and burst damage.\"}],\"weakAgainst\":[{\"heroSlug\":\"akai\",\"heroName\":\"Akai\",\"advantage\":\"weak\",\"tip\":\"Karina is countered by Tanky heroes with CC abilities, like Akai and Khufra because they can tank her damage, and protect their allies from her.\"},{\"heroSlug\":\"khufra\",\"heroName\":\"Khufra\",\"advantage\":\"weak\",\"tip\":\"Karina is countered by Tanky heroes with CC abilities, like Akai and Khufra because they can tank her damage, and protect their allies from her.\"}]},\"splashArt\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/file/mlbb/homepage/100_37b5cfef887a7afc63dfaf7b6dfd65c4.jpg\",\"portrait\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_f49394186dc0e55d545da8377be83280.png\",\"officialMatchups\":[{\"kind\":\"best_ally\",\"heroId\":\"48\",\"heroName\":\"Diggie\",\"heroSlug\":\"diggie\",\"icon\":\"https://akmwebstatic.yuanzhanapp.com/web/madmin/image_84b30de71c6315ecc936a8b4d5076efc.png\",\"tip\":\"Diggie’s ultimate can help out Karina in a pinch, and Cyclops’ ultimate can create more opportunities for Karina to deal damage.\"},{\"kind\":\"counters\",\"heroId\":\"46\",\"heroName\":\"Odette\",\"heroSlug\":\"odette\",\"icon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/madmin/image/071fd5539ac4ba53b1dc27195cd6d4bd.png?w=150-150-fff8da\",\"tip\":\"Karina’High Mobility make her a nightmare to marksmans and mages who have no displacement skills.\"},{\"kind\":\"countered_by\",\"heroId\":\"9\",\"heroName\":\"Akai\",\"heroSlug\":\"akai\",\"icon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/madmin/image/25141fb8aa27cfbe9f030449721b11af.png?w=150-150-4f3225\",\"tip\":\"Akai’s ultimate can effectively stop assassins from attacking.\"}],\"skills\":{\"skills\":[{\"name\":\"Shadow Combo\",\"type\":\"Passive\",\"description\":\"Karina's third consecutive attack against the same enemy deals 100 (+ 5 (+2.5% Total Magic Power)% target's Lost HP) extra True Damage.\\n\\nIf the target is an enemy hero, this attack also reduces the cooldowns of her non-Ultimate skills by 1.5s.\\nDamage dealt to creeps is capped at 2000 True Damage.\",\"descriptionRich\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Karina's third consecutive attack against the same enemy deals 100 (+ 5\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" (+2.5% Total Magic Power)\",\"color\":\"#62f8fe\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"% target's Lost HP) extra True Damage.\\n\\nIf the target is an enemy hero, this attack also reduces the cooldowns of her non-Ultimate skills by 1.5s.\\nDamage dealt to creeps is capped at 2000 True Damage.\"}],\"cooldown\":null,\"manaCost\":null,\"icon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_fb37b0cbc5e9952ec756e3f58c5df22f.png\",\"tags\":[\"Buff\",\"Damage\"]},{\"name\":\"Dance of Blades\",\"type\":\"Skill 1\",\"description\":\"Karina enters the Dance of Blades state for up to 3.5s, gaining 45% Movement Speed and blocking all Basic Attacks. Blocked attacks trigger a counterattack that deals 100 (+30% Total Magic Power) Magic Damage to the attacker (firing a Shadowblade at ranged attackers or triggering Dance of Blades against melee attackers).\\nThis effect has a 0.4s cooldown).\\n\\nCasting a Basic Attack or Shadow Assault ends the Dance of Blades state, empowering Karina's next Basic Attack to deal 160 (+60% Total Magic Power) critical Magic Damage and slow the target by 45% for 1s.\",\"descriptionRich\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Karina enters the \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Dance of Blades\",\"color\":\"#a6aafb\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" state for up to 3.5s, gaining 45% Movement Speed and blocking all Basic Attacks. Blocked attacks trigger a counterattack that deals 100\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" (+30% Total Magic Power)\",\"color\":\"#62f8fe\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" Magic Damage to the attacker (firing a \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Shadowblade\",\"color\":\"#a6aafb\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" at ranged attackers or triggering \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Dance of Blades\",\"color\":\"#a6aafb\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" against melee attackers).\\nThis effect has a 0.4s cooldown).\\n\\nCasting a Basic Attack or \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Shadow Assault\",\"color\":\"#a6aafb\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" ends the \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Dance of Blades\",\"color\":\"#a6aafb\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" state, empowering Karina's next Basic Attack to deal 160\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" (+60% Total Magic Power)\",\"color\":\"#62f8fe\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" critical Magic Damage and slow the target by 45% for 1s.\"}],\"cooldown\":\"6s\",\"manaCost\":\"50\",\"icon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_94328c502082dd096eb4be3d95655b07.png\",\"tags\":[\"Buff\",\"Speed Up\"]},{\"name\":\"Dance of Death\",\"type\":\"Skill 2\",\"description\":\"Karina launches a spinning slash, dealing 375 (+125% Total Magic Power) Magic Damage to nearby enemies.\",\"descriptionRich\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Karina launches a spinning slash, dealing 375\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" (+125% Total Magic Power)\",\"color\":\"#62f8fe\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" Magic Damage to nearby enemies.\"}],\"cooldown\":\"6s\",\"manaCost\":\"60\",\"icon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_da228e14f0756e84580cb08ede6a1283.png\",\"tags\":[\"AOE\"]},{\"name\":\"Shadow Assault\",\"type\":\"Ultimate\",\"description\":\"Karina dashes to the enemy hero, dealing 350 (+160% Total Magic Power) Magic Damage, applying a Shadow Sigil to the target, and leaving a Shadowform behind them.\\n\\nThe Shadow Sigil and Shadowform both last 5s. If the target dies during this time, this skill's cooldown resets immediately.\\n\\nUse Again: Karina dashes back to the Shadowform's location, dealing 150 (+50% Total Magic Power) Magic Damage to enemies along the way.\",\"descriptionRich\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Karina dashes to the enemy hero, dealing 350\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" (+160% Total Magic Power)\",\"color\":\"#62f8fe\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" Magic Damage, applying a \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Shadow Sigil\",\"color\":\"#a6aafb\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" to the target, and leaving a \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Shadowform\",\"color\":\"#a6aafb\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" behind them.\\n\\nThe \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Shadow Sigil\",\"color\":\"#a6aafb\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" and \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Shadowform\",\"color\":\"#a6aafb\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" both last 5s. If the target dies during this time, this skill's cooldown resets immediately.\\n\\n\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Use Again\",\"color\":\"#a6aafb\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\": Karina dashes back to the \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Shadowform\",\"color\":\"#a6aafb\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"'s location, dealing 150\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" (+50% Total Magic Power)\",\"color\":\"#62f8fe\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" Magic Damage to enemies along the way.\"}],\"cooldown\":\"34s\",\"manaCost\":\"100\",\"icon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_889d1d71cef50ed1121ee68b5097954e.png\",\"tags\":[\"Burst\",\"Mobility\"]}],\"skillUpgradePriority\":\"3-2-1\",\"skillPriorityTip\":\"Level up 1st skill first.Then level up 2nd skill.\\nRetribution - Increasing your jungle efficiency would be the best choice.\",\"skillPriorityTipRich\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Level up 1st skill first.Then level up 2nd skill.\"},{\"type\":\"lineBreak\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Retribution - Increasing your jungle efficiency would be the best choice.\"}]},\"synergies\":[{\"heroSlug\":\"tigreal\",\"heroName\":\"Tigreal\",\"synergyScore\":8,\"reason\":\"Karina works well with heroes who can pull enemies together, such as Tigreal and Faramis, since her Ultimate and 2nd Skill also hits anyone near her main target, setting them up to be chain killed by her Ultimate.\"},{\"heroSlug\":\"faramis\",\"heroName\":\"Faramis\",\"synergyScore\":8,\"reason\":\"Karina works well with heroes who can pull enemies together, such as Tigreal and Faramis, since her Ultimate and 2nd Skill also hits anyone near her main target, setting them up to be chain killed by her Ultimate.\"}],\"combos\":[{\"type\":\"teamfight\",\"title\":\"TEAMFIGHT COMBOS\",\"description\":\"In teamfights, close in on the enemy using Karina's 1st Skill and cut into their formation with her Ultimate. Use her 2nd Skill for a quick AOE followed by her Ultimate to dash back to her Shadowform. Finally, use her 1st Skill again and enhanced Basic Attacks to chase down enemies.\",\"skillSequence\":[{\"skillId\":810,\"skillIcon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_94328c502082dd096eb4be3d95655b07.png\"},{\"skillId\":830,\"skillIcon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_889d1d71cef50ed1121ee68b5097954e.png\"},{\"skillId\":820,\"skillIcon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_da228e14f0756e84580cb08ede6a1283.png\"},{\"skillId\":830,\"skillIcon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_889d1d71cef50ed1121ee68b5097954e.png\"},{\"skillId\":800,\"skillIcon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_f98d2e98eaebfb31c6c5101cf1c3201a.png\"}]},{\"type\":\"laning\",\"title\":\"LANING COMBOS\",\"description\":\"In the laning phase, use Karina's 1st Skill first to enter the Dance of Blades state and pounce on the enemy using the dash from her enhanced Basic Attack. Follow up with her 2nd Skill and Basic Attacks to trigger her Passive.\",\"skillSequence\":[{\"skillId\":810,\"skillIcon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_94328c502082dd096eb4be3d95655b07.png\"},{\"skillId\":800,\"skillIcon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_f98d2e98eaebfb31c6c5101cf1c3201a.png\"},{\"skillId\":820,\"skillIcon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_da228e14f0756e84580cb08ede6a1283.png\"},{\"skillId\":800,\"skillIcon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_f98d2e98eaebfb31c6c5101cf1c3201a.png\"}]}],\"metaDescription\":\"Karina build, counter, and strategy guide for Mobile Legends. Kill-reset assassin mechanics, Genius Wand spike, target priority, and when she is the trap pick.\",\"builds\":[],\"overviewLede\":\"Karina is less an assassin than a kill-reset engine. Her ultimate resets when the marked target dies, and her passive refunds cooldown on both other skills on every third consecutive hit, which means the moment she catches the first low-HP target the rest of the enemy team is on borrowed time. That only happens if the draft actually gives her a first pick to catch.\"},\"serverLocale\":\"en\",\"curatedBuilds\":{\"source\":\"curated\",\"hero\":\"karina\",\"patch\":\"2.1.67\",\"lastReviewed\":\"2026-05-13\",\"stalePatch\":true,\"currentPatch\":\"2.2.16a\",\"builds\":[{\"slot\":1,\"id\":\"jungle-reset-burst\",\"name\":\"Jungle Reset Burst\",\"roleContext\":\"Jungle\",\"items\":[{\"slug\":\"arcane-boots\",\"name\":\"Arcane Boots\",\"cost\":690,\"fixed\":false},{\"slug\":\"starlium-scythe\",\"name\":\"Starlium Scythe\",\"cost\":2220,\"fixed\":false},{\"slug\":\"genius-wand\",\"name\":\"Genius Wand\",\"cost\":2000,\"fixed\":false},{\"slug\":\"holy-crystal\",\"name\":\"Holy Crystal\",\"cost\":3000,\"fixed\":false},{\"slug\":\"divine-glaive\",\"name\":\"Divine Glaive\",\"cost\":1970,\"fixed\":false},{\"slug\":\"blood-wings\",\"name\":\"Blood Wings\",\"cost\":2100,\"fixed\":false}],\"coreItems\":[{\"slug\":\"starlium-scythe\",\"name\":\"Starlium Scythe\"},{\"slug\":\"genius-wand\",\"name\":\"Genius Wand\"},{\"slug\":\"holy-crystal\",\"name\":\"Holy Crystal\"}],\"emblem\":{\"slug\":\"assassin\",\"name\":\"Assassin Emblem\",\"talents\":[{\"slug\":\"rupture\",\"name\":\"Rupture\",\"iconUrl\":\"/images/talents/rupture.png\",\"bucket\":\"standard\"},{\"slug\":\"seasoned-hunter\",\"name\":\"Seasoned Hunter\",\"iconUrl\":\"/images/talents/seasoned-hunter.png\",\"bucket\":\"standard\"},{\"slug\":\"killing-spree\",\"name\":\"Killing Spree\",\"iconUrl\":\"/images/talents/killing-spree.png\",\"bucket\":\"core\"}]},\"spell\":{\"slug\":\"retribution\",\"name\":\"Retribution\"},\"blessing\":{\"slug\":\"ice-retribution\",\"name\":\"Ice Retribution\"},\"flexItems\":[{\"item\":{\"slug\":\"tough-boots\",\"name\":\"Tough Boots\"},\"replace\":{\"slug\":\"arcane-boots\",\"name\":\"Arcane Boots\"},\"trigger\":\"Use when the enemy draft has chain crowd control that catches Karina before Shadow Assault can reset.\"},{\"item\":{\"slug\":\"winter-crown\",\"name\":\"Winter Crown\"},\"replace\":{\"slug\":\"blood-wings\",\"name\":\"Blood Wings\"},\"trigger\":\"Use when one stasis button is needed to survive the counter-burst after the first dive.\"},{\"item\":{\"slug\":\"glowing-wand\",\"name\":\"Glowing Wand\"},\"replace\":{\"slug\":\"blood-wings\",\"name\":\"Blood Wings\"},\"trigger\":\"Use when shields or HP regen keep the first reset target alive and the enemy has not stacked heavy Magic Defense.\"},{\"item\":{\"slug\":\"immortality\",\"name\":\"Immortality\"},\"replace\":{\"slug\":\"blood-wings\",\"name\":\"Blood Wings\"},\"trigger\":\"Use for final Lord fights where a revive is worth more than extra magic power and shield tempo.\"}],\"notes\":\"Default ranked jungle setup built around Starlium follow-up damage, Genius Wand shred, and Ice Retribution stickiness for the first reset.\",\"totalCost\":11980,\"statLines\":[{\"key\":\"magicpower\",\"labelKey\":\"common.stats.magicPower\",\"unit\":\"flat\",\"group\":\"offensive\",\"value\":465,\"sources\":[\"Starlium Scythe\",\"Genius Wand\",\"Holy Crystal\",\"Divine Glaive\",\"Blood Wings\"]},{\"key\":\"magicpen\",\"labelKey\":\"common.stats.magicPenetration\",\"unit\":\"percent\",\"group\":\"offensive\",\"value\":40,\"sources\":[\"Divine Glaive\"]},{\"key\":\"magicpenFlat\",\"labelKey\":\"common.stats.magicPenetration\",\"unit\":\"flat\",\"group\":\"offensive\",\"value\":20,\"sources\":[\"Arcane Boots\",\"Genius Wand\"]},{\"key\":\"hybridsteal\",\"labelKey\":\"common.stats.hybridLifesteal\",\"unit\":\"percent\",\"group\":\"offensive\",\"value\":8,\"sources\":[\"Starlium Scythe\"]},{\"key\":\"mpregen\",\"labelKey\":\"common.stats.manaRegen\",\"unit\":\"flat\",\"group\":\"utility\",\"value\":6,\"sources\":[\"Starlium Scythe\"]},{\"key\":\"movespeed\",\"labelKey\":\"common.stats.movementSpeed\",\"unit\":\"flat\",\"group\":\"utility\",\"value\":40,\"sources\":[\"Arcane Boots\"]},{\"key\":\"movespeedPct\",\"labelKey\":\"common.stats.movementSpeed\",\"unit\":\"percent\",\"group\":\"utility\",\"value\":5,\"sources\":[\"Genius Wand\"]},{\"key\":\"cdreduction\",\"labelKey\":\"common.stats.cooldownReduction\",\"unit\":\"percent\",\"group\":\"utility\",\"value\":10,\"sources\":[\"Starlium Scythe\"]}],\"conflicts\":[],\"simulatorUrl\":\"/build-simulator?hero=karina\u0026items=arcane-boots%2Cstarlium-scythe%2Cgenius-wand%2Choly-crystal%2Cdivine-glaive%2Cblood-wings\u0026blessing=ice-retribution\u0026spell=retribution\u0026emblem=assassin\u0026talents=rupture%2Cseasoned-hunter%2Ckilling-spree\u0026flex=tough-boots.arcane-boots%2Cwinter-crown.blood-wings%2Cglowing-wand.blood-wings%2Cimmortality.blood-wings\"},{\"slot\":2,\"id\":\"jungle-sustain-snowball\",\"name\":\"Jungle Sustain Snowball\",\"roleContext\":\"Jungle\",\"items\":[{\"slug\":\"arcane-boots\",\"name\":\"Arcane Boots\",\"cost\":690,\"fixed\":false},{\"slug\":\"starlium-scythe\",\"name\":\"Starlium Scythe\",\"cost\":2220,\"fixed\":false},{\"slug\":\"concentrated-energy\",\"name\":\"Concentrated Energy\",\"cost\":2020,\"fixed\":false},{\"slug\":\"holy-crystal\",\"name\":\"Holy Crystal\",\"cost\":3000,\"fixed\":false},{\"slug\":\"divine-glaive\",\"name\":\"Divine Glaive\",\"cost\":1970,\"fixed\":false},{\"slug\":\"blood-wings\",\"name\":\"Blood Wings\",\"cost\":2100,\"fixed\":false}],\"coreItems\":[{\"slug\":\"starlium-scythe\",\"name\":\"Starlium Scythe\"},{\"slug\":\"concentrated-energy\",\"name\":\"Concentrated Energy\"},{\"slug\":\"holy-crystal\",\"name\":\"Holy Crystal\"}],\"emblem\":{\"slug\":\"mage\",\"name\":\"Mage Emblem\",\"talents\":[{\"slug\":\"rupture\",\"name\":\"Rupture\",\"iconUrl\":\"/images/talents/rupture.png\",\"bucket\":\"standard\"},{\"slug\":\"seasoned-hunter\",\"name\":\"Seasoned Hunter\",\"iconUrl\":\"/images/talents/seasoned-hunter.png\",\"bucket\":\"standard\"},{\"slug\":\"leth