text-xl md:text-[26px] font-heading font-bold text-[#F0D060] mt-10 mb-4 first:mt-0 text-balance uppercase tracking-[0.04em] leading-tight relative\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"aria-hidden\":\"true\",\"className\":\"block w-10 h-[3px] bg-gradient-to-r from-[#F0D060] to-[#C8AA6E]/0 mb-3\"}],\"Is this a Karina game?\"]}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"p\",\"p-0\",{\"className\":\"text-[#9BA0B4] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-[15px]\",\"children\":\"Karina's draft question is not \\\"does my team need a jungler\\\", it is \\\"does the enemy team have at least one squishy who positions badly\\\". Her entire kit is built to chain kills. If the enemy back line is a single marksman surrounded by three frontline CC specialists, she never gets the reset loop started and every dive ends with her ult on a long cooldown and no reset to show for it. If the enemy is running two fragile carries (Layla plus Lylia, Miya plus Odette, Lesley plus Selena), she punishes every clipped positioning error in perpetuity.\"}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"p\",\"p-1\",{\"className\":\"text-[#9BA0B4] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-[15px]\",\"children\":[\"Patch 2.2.16 (\",[\"$\",\"$L40\",\"a-0\",{\"href\":\"/patch-notes\",\"prefetch\":false,\"className\":\"text-[#C8AA6E] hover:text-[#F0D060] underline decoration-[#C8AA6E]/40 hover:decoration-[#F0D060] transition-colors\",\"children\":\"patch notes\"}],\") cut Dance of Blades' cooldown and moved real damage onto its enhanced basic. The buff raises her floor once the first kill lands; it does not change what the draft has to give her.\"]}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"p\",\"p-2\",{\"className\":\"text-[#9BA0B4] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-[15px]\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"strong\",\"strong-0\",{\"className\":\"text-[#E8E6E3] font-semibold\",\"children\":\"Lock her when\"}],\" the enemy has two or more 2500-HP-ish heroes who rely on range instead of escape mobility, your team has any form of setup (Mathilda ult, Franco hook, Khufra bounce on your side, Kaja suppress), and the enemy lacks hard counter-initiation like Eudora or Aurora sitting on her ult.\"]}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"p\",\"p-3\",{\"className\":\"text-[#9BA0B4] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-[15px]\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"strong\",\"strong-0\",{\"className\":\"text-[#E8E6E3] font-semibold\",\"children\":\"Bench her when\"}],\" the enemy picks any of these: Eudora (one combo one-shots Karina the instant she dives), Khufra (Bouncing Ball interrupts her ult dash and his ult suppresses her during her shadow window), Aurora (instant freeze the moment the dash animation starts), Valir (point-click knockback plus a Burning Soul slow that cancels her speed buff), or Franco with a flicker. Also bench her when your own team is a poke comp with no engage. Karina does not initiate. She cleans up. If nobody else on your team can create a pick, she sits in the jungle hitting creeps until the 25-minute surrender vote.\"]}],\"\\n\",\"$L7e\",\"\\n\",\"$L7f\",\"\\n\",\"$L80\",\"\\n\",\"$L81\",\"\\n\",\"$L82\",\"\\n\",\"$L83\",\"\\n\",\"$L84\",\"\\n\",\"$L85\",\"\\n\",\"$L86\",\"\\n\",\"$L87\",\"\\n\",\"$L88\",\"\\n\",\"$L89\",\"\\n\",\"$L8a\",\"\\n\",\"$L8b\",\"\\n\",\"$L8c\",\"\\n\",\"$L8d\",\"\\n\",\"$L8e\"],\"$L8f\",\"$L90\"],\"$L91\"]}]]}]]}]\n"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"a9:I[392015,[\"$7\",\"$8\",\"$9\",\"$a\",\"$b\",\"$2e\",\"$3e\",\"$3f\"],\"default\"]\nb8:I[131354,[\"$7\",\"$8\",\"$9\",\"$a\",\"$b\",\"$2e\",\"$3e\",\"$3f\"],\"default\"]\n6d:[\"$\",\"$L6a\",\"yin\",{\"href\":\"/heroes/yin\",\"className\":\"group block\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"relative bg-surface-4 border border-mlbb-gold/20 overflow-hidden card-hover hover:border-mlbb-gold/50\",\"style\":{\"boxShadow\":\"0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.3)\"},\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex items-center gap-3 p-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"relative w-14 h-14 rounded-full overflow-hidden flex-shrink-0 bg-surface-3\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"$L6b\",null,{\"src\":\"https://akmweb.youn